WEBVTT

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:01.090
You think I'm a coward?

00:00:01.630 --> 00:00:06.660
A ninja is a person who lives by being hated by others.

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:10.320
If you have the power, you will be independent and arrogant.

00:00:11.630 --> 00:00:14.190
At first, you may be desired and sought after.

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:29.340
If you believe in love and think you are a human being,

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.000
There's no such thing as a future.

00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:01.520
Thank you.

00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:36.720
I'll become the god of this world!

00:01:37.220 --> 00:01:38.780
Don't mess with me!

00:01:38.780 --> 00:01:42.440
Sensei!

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:43.880
My friends-

00:01:45.830 --> 00:01:49.480
Kill them! I'll make Shinobi's world a peaceful place!
